description: Project purpose and product direction for the 50th wedding anniversary invitation website
alwaysApply: true
---

This project is a premium 50th wedding anniversary invitation website.

The emotional tone should be:
- Elegant
- Warm
- Romantic
- Family-centered
- Respectful
- Timeless
- Celebratory, not flashy

Avoid generic wedding-template aesthetics. This is not a modern influencer wedding site. It should feel like a meaningful family celebration honoring 50 years of marriage.

The website should include:
- Hero section with couple names and anniversary date
- Short emotional message
- Event details
- RSVP section or button
- Photo gallery or memory section
- Optional timeline of the couple’s story
- Dress code or gift note if needed
- Location/map section
- Footer with a warm closing message

Prioritize mobile-first design because most guests will open the invitation on their phone.